    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/22bd7b8efbaeba2f262e2cf393faa8e5.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/22bd7b8efbaeba2f262e2cf393faa8e5.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Odd Infinitum </i> is a 16-bit  shoot-em-up boss rush featuring 11 exhilarating boss battles against machine, alien, and pilot foes alike.\u00a0 Combat the oncoming threats using an arsenal of elite sci-fi weaponry at your disposal. The cast of characters you'll meet on the adventure can provide useful items and gear... or have nefarious intent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/46028efd4988c749a06b95a1b53ff3f6.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/46028efd4988c749a06b95a1b53ff3f6.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Battles - a mining machine gone rogue, a massive wall of writhing flesh, an angelic husk, an afflicted paramilitary squad, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Loadouts - build your loadout with a combination of primary laser weapons, power secondary missiles, and augments granting passive and active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters - each character you meet can help you combat the oncoming alien invasion... or may stab you in the back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/167801f3404fbc8d98d244dd1facc992.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/167801f3404fbc8d98d244dd1facc992.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 3065. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 31st century, humanity expanded its reach beyond Earth and colonized a galaxy-spanning empire.  Although alliances with certain alien races are tenuous, the human race enjoys a time of relative peace.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a spacecraft pilot freshly recruited from the academy into the United Systems Defense Force (U.S.D.F.), humanity's first line of defense against extraterrestrial threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a distress signal is sent out from a remote asteroid colony, you are sent to investigate.  What you encounter is unlike anything humanity has yet to see.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/22bd7b8efbaeba2f262e2cf393faa8e5.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/22bd7b8efbaeba2f262e2cf393faa8e5.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Odd Infinitum </i> is a 16-bit  shoot-em-up boss rush featuring 11 exhilarating boss battles against machine, alien, and pilot foes alike.\u00a0 Combat the oncoming threats using an arsenal of elite sci-fi weaponry at your disposal. The cast of characters you'll meet on the adventure can provide useful items and gear... or have nefarious intent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/46028efd4988c749a06b95a1b53ff3f6.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/46028efd4988c749a06b95a1b53ff3f6.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Battles - a mining machine gone rogue, a massive wall of writhing flesh, an angelic husk, an afflicted paramilitary squad, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Loadouts - build your loadout with a combination of primary laser weapons, power secondary missiles, and augments granting passive and active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters - each character you meet can help you combat the oncoming alien invasion... or may stab you in the back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/167801f3404fbc8d98d244dd1facc992.poster.avif?t=1746067609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842140/extras/167801f3404fbc8d98d244dd1facc992.apng?t=1746067609\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 3065. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 31st century, humanity expanded its reach beyond Earth and colonized a galaxy-spanning empire.  Although alliances with certain alien races are tenuous, the human race enjoys a time of relative peace.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a spacecraft pilot freshly recruited from the academy into the United Systems Defense Force (U.S.D.F.), humanity's first line of defense against extraterrestrial threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a distress signal is sent out from a remote asteroid colony, you are sent to investigate.  What you encounter is unlike anything humanity has yet to see.</p>",
    "short_description": "Arm yourself with a variety of tactical weapons and take to the cosmos in a boss-rush shoot-em-up inspired by SNES shooters. You are a pilot fresh from the academy, thrust into a battle to defend humanity from the darkest abominations of the Infinitum. What lurks among the stars has a plan for you\u2026",
